    "title": "Will Smith, Jada Pinkett and Willow Smith Support Jaden Smith at Christian Louboutin's Spring 2027 Presentation - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Karla Rodriguez ,\n6 hours ago The Christian Louboutin men’s spring 2027 presentation was a family affair. Will Smith , Jada Pinkett Smith , Willow Smith, Trey Smith and grandmother Adrienne Banfield-Norris all showed up at the event at the Palais Brongniart on Wednesday in support of Jaden Smith, who showed his sophomore collection as the brand’s first men’s creative director.\nZendaya Adds a Dreamy Glitter Finish to Custom Louboutins in Rome\nThe Smith family at the event. Getty Images Naturally, they all arrived modeling shoe styles from the luxury footwear designer. Jada Pinkett Smith went back into the archives for her shoes. The “Girls Trip” star wore a pair from the Christian Louboutin 20th Anniversary Collection, which was released in 2012.\nShe opted for the “Bow Bow” sandals in black grosgrain and PVC. The heels feature translucent PVC material with tiny grosgrain ribbon bows in black, an open toe, and a snap closure ankle strap. The dainty heels featured a round, almond toe silhouette.\nA close-up of the shoes. GC Images The Oscar-winning actor went for a more recent style. Smith opted for the Christian Louboutin Cocoriclou shoes, which feature a black leather design and the distinctive red sole with metal spike embellishments along the sole. The designer created the boots in a Derby version with laces and a Chelsea boot.\nWillow wore one of her brother’s designs to the event. She wore the Christian Louboutin Asclepius Sling leather mules, which retail for $1,390. The contemporary design features the Maison Christian Louboutin penny coin detail on the upper. The Asclepius Sling is crafted from black calf leather and blends a classic loafer style with an edge. The model features a metallic detail on the back strap and a padded footbed.\nJaden Smith Told a Multigenerational Story at Christian Louboutin\nWill Smith and Jada Pinkett Smith GC Images Trey Smith, the eldest sibling, also wore a contemporary style from the brand. He opted for the Louboutin Trapman TCT 2 boots. The lace-up boot design features a sleek silhouette, highlighted by a sculptural molded shell toe, a rugged lug sole, and two sets of metallic lace hooks. It is crafted in black calf leather and features the Maison Christian Louboutin Canopy white signature laser-etched and hand-painted on the heel. The internal footbed, crafted from cushioned foam, delivers exceptional softness and support for a city shoe.\nBanfield-Norris, who is Jaden’s grandmother, served a softer contrast to her grandkids’ shoes, opting for the elegant Christian Louboutin Senora leopard-print sandals, which feature a distinctive red sole and a T-strap design.\nChristian Louboutin’s spring 2027 men’s presentation in Paris. Courtesy of Louboutin Ahead of the collection’s debut, the creative director gave FN a walk-through of the brand’s Washington Street men’s boutique in New York. “I feel like I have a very abstract design philosophy,” Smith said at the store. “And sometimes I like trippy psychedelic ideas. So, I try to merge that within the heritage of what Louboutin already has showcased through his craftsmanship.”\nWill and Jada Pinkett Smith’s Style Through the Years, Photos View Gallery\nReese Witherspoon Brings Elle Woods Into 2026 With Feathered Louboutin Sandals\n10",
    "summary": "The heels feature translucent PVC material with tiny grosgrain ribbon bows in black, an open toe, and a snap closure ankle strap. The lace-up boot design features a sleek silhouette, highlighted by a sculptural molded shell toe, a rugged lug sole, and two sets of metallic lace hooks. It is crafted in black calf leather and features the Maison Christian Louboutin Canopy white signature laser-etched and hand-painted on the heel.",
